# Fixture migrated: the three refusal programs sit in spawn/, net/, write/, each its own package with no authority block; spawn imports use core.process.[cmd] (E1004 fix); markers are fixture-relative spawned.txt / written.txt
fixture: package_without_authority_block_refuses_spawn_net_and_file_write.fixture
